{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Group Trip Cost Split 是一款為多人旅行設計的分帳記錄工具，適合與朋友或家人旅行時整理共同支出與還款狀況。原價 US $0.99，目前<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-35.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>旅行分帳與結算</h2>\n<p>此 App 可快速記錄支出，選擇付款人，並按平均、指定金額、百分比或加權比例分攤，支援多位付款人。離線時可使用，可設定旅程預設貨幣及最多三種其他貨幣，保存參考匯率、收據相片、預算及自訂分類。它會顯示誰欠誰、個人交易紀錄、部分還款與退款，確認結清後可封存旅程，亦可共享旅程及匯出 PDF、Excel 或 CSV 備份。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-49-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-50-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-51-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-52-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-53-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-54-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Group Trip Cost Split</li><li>應用類別：Travel</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/group-trip-cost-split/id6811277369?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T14:21:57.412294+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":306,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T14:11:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T17:38:40.425582+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T14:18:47.800595+00:00","content_hash":"02212afc65feb26795c7e819d9aee42aeae44d32dfa7f25fc5f19918118a9a9a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}